# REST API for Book Management — Full Implementation

## Overview

This project implements a complete CRUD REST API for managing books using **Node.js** and **Express.js**. The design follows REST conventions (resource-based URLs, proper HTTP methods, status codes) and uses an in-memory array as storage to keep the example self-contained. Every function is documented with JSDoc, custom error classes provide structured error handling, and middleware handles validation and errors centrally. Below you'll find each file with detailed explanations of *why* certain patterns were chosen.

